Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Sand Shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 16
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.39,0:00:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That person is too awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.11,0:00:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We must rescue her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can’t deal with them with our ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,ability
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have successfully copied their ability
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is indeed my invention
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s catch up with that person quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and bring Xiao Mei back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:01:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t walk in this kind of weather and environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.17,0:01:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we need a vehicle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.01,0:01:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Desert Night Paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.89,0:01:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The grand prize is a car
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.99,0:01:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so prosperous here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your first time here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.39,0:01:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to our Desert Night Paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Any transaction can be done here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you need
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we need a vehicle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I have vehicles
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.59,0:01:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The truck known as the “Little Tyrant of Transportation”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.35,0:01:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The moped known as the “Ship of the Desert”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.38,0:01:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you sell your vehicles?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.11,0:01:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you the best price
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,After deducting handling fees,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,referral fees, and cleaning fees,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.78,0:02:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,100 bottles of water in exchange for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What? 100 bottles of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll give you another discount. How many bottles of water do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we have so much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So little is not enough
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go there first to play games and win prizes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The final prize is a vehicle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We are good at playing games
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The water is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s the arena in front
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that you can participate as long as you have the equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winner will also get a luxury car
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Qualified
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.85,0:03:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,next person
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not qualified, no equipment
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this not considered equipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,next person
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t this Sand Shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, calm down and watch carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn’t have a scarf, it’s not Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.49,0:04:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right, he’s not Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can participate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Sand Shadow so powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, please let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, it’s okay if you don’t let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then can you go back and help me get my doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t be able to sleep without it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, everyone, to the live venue
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to watch the Ultimate Battle: The Next Generation 3.0 game!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please welcome our contestants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get the car quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules of the competition are simple
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.76,0:05:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use any method to eliminate your opponents
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The last person standing in the arena wins
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,now I declare
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.71,0:05:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The game starts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m determined to be the champion this time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying. Crying can easily cause unnecessary trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to either
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’m scared without the doll
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t talk
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s strange. I clearly saw there was light here just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.33,0:07:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I see it wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s go and see
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.89,0:07:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave if you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.80,0:07:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Isn’t that Sand Shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she the one
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The number one master
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf’s whereabouts are strange
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How could it be possible for us to meet her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.92,0:07:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be fake
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Heroine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us, we know we were wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our treasure. I give it to you to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:07:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:07:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,yes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,stop crying
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not my doll
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.47,0:08:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,After fierce competition, these players are the only ones left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s time to add some highlights
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We will put something into the field to stimulate the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As for what to put in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.28,0:08:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to put in a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s add one more monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Monster
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.83,0:09:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll cast another monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We also choose monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster knocked down many contestants at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No. 3 and No. 99 are the only ones left on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.05,0:10:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I so hungry suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, I forgot that my invention consumes energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations to contestant No. 3 for receiving the materials provided by the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.81,0:10:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The right to use the laser ray cannon once
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.53,0:10:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to drop off food for No. 99 Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem. Please pay two bottles of water first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We will immediately put supplies into the hands of No. 99 for you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,two bottles of water
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s this wild boar again. He uses sneak attacks every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will help me defeat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s Slowy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a private box. What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m looking for Slowy here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you know me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.64,0:11:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course everyone knows your name
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here this time to recommend a player with great potential to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.61,0:11:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,who is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie No. 99
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.45,0:11:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks a bit weak
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don’t know why I like him quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll vote for him this time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations to contestant No. 99 for winning the food provided by the audience
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,An excellent contestant must first know how to hide himself
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of losing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.68,0:12:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
